    "s1": { "x": 4080, "y": 0, "w": 380, "text": "The logo is split day / night. So is the product now: light mode is a pine morning (cream, sky, lime, sun), dark mode is a starlit ridge (midnight, slate, lime, star-yellow). Bricolage Grotesque for headlines, Geist for UI, Geist Mono for codes. Motifs come from the tickets: skyline, contours, stub notches, rubber stamps.", "fill": "green" }
